            {
              "text": "26:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mika",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": mu Giheburayo handitswe Mikaya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " w’i Moresheti yavugishwa n’Imana ku ngoma ya Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda; kandi yabariye abantu bose b’i Buyuda, at’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ati Siyoni hazosīzwa hahinduke nk’ubusīze, Yerusalemu hazohinduka ibirundo vy’ amasakamburira, n’umurwa wubatswekw iyi ngoro uzohinduka nk’ikibira kiri ku mpinga z’imisozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
