              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 5:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega Hezekiya umwami w’i Buyuda n’Abayuda bose mugira ngo bāramwishe? Hezekiya ntiyaciye atinya Uhoraho, akamukomera ibobo, Uhoraho na we akīgarura akareka ivyago yari yabageneye? Twogira ico tumugira twoba dukwegeye ubugingo bgacu ivyago bihambaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hāri n’uwundi yavugishwa mw izina ry’Uhoraho, ni Uriya mwene Shemaya w’i Kiriyati‐yeyarimu; uyo yavugishijwe n’ Imana ku bizoba kur’ iki gisagara no kur’ iki gihugu bihwanye n’amajambo yose ya Yeremiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Yehoyakimu n’intōre ziwe zose n’abaganwa bose, bumvise amajambo yiwe, umwami ashaka kumwica; ariko Uriya avyumvise, agira ubgoba, arahunga, aja muri Egiputa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 26:22"
          },
